      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `11ff15691c1d46eff2b2036ec11332186e8f011af6c2e2a66a0e7291712d1b40--EurobodallaLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 8ae6a6bbb767c58728890f1b424defd0be1d6c6cc3d7da35bd02617ae057c61a | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 3c353e976ca03db9c30249bb2f5ebc14a20f325b7ca7fb6a2161c44ad52dd147 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 2dc4ffb4c665e9e53d16462f1110b4161f256460330f5c24e437cec44b96b7ea | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 743f3d46a01e2094ac3bff58143c157d3897128c121ddb5eb54e1c704393a32f | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | f04684d9017877d231b9d0f19753298f8d5f6528e6c3eff61bad0f622d522aed | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 7a068089eee2c1baa0503ba09cd3af3d2d48f814586500a451ea0e059780f0d8 | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 08f4e956480b33091210dae387df0bd43dbe95b3f996df2035921081a32ed28a | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
